/ActualText (Recursive Feature Elimination with Cross-Validation \(RFECV\) is the technique obtained when we combine RFE and cross-validation. By identifying the number of features that consistently improve model performance over multiple folds, RFECV mitigates overfitting concerns.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
